Source: sysible-branding
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Sysible <maintainers@sysible.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: sysible-branding
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sysible Linux visual branding (SES)
 The SES brand assets that are not otherwise packaged: the GRUB boot theme, the
 GDM login/lock background, the Sysible application icons, and the Sora brand
 font. Installing or upgrading this package re-applies the current brand to the
 running system (regenerates the GRUB menu, the GDM background gresource, and the
 icon/font caches), so branding updates arrive over apt without a reinstall.
